He added that during this internship, he strongly expects to have the opportunity to work as a full-time employee at the company that is doing this internship, because the internship for one month has been good. Well, there is interest from the company itself.
Meanwhile, So Kakada, another trainee in the field of electrical installation in the building at the National Polytechnic Institute of Cambodia, also said: "I am very happy to learn the skills well in the class and have the opportunity to train at the company. Private A2Z, a construction company, because it is an opportunity to learn more, strengthen capacity and especially will have the opportunity to work at this good company.
He added that he has been training for one month after studying for almost four months at the National Polytechnic Institute of Cambodia and expects the company to be able to recruit full-time employees after completing the internship. Being here.
At the same time, the trainees thanked the Royal Government of Cambodia for launching this vocational and technical training program, which provides an opportunity for young people to study short-term skills and find jobs.
