(Phnom Penh): As of the afternoon of May 3, 2024, this is the third time that the National Gendarmerie has summoned the suspect, Ith Dany, to appear in connection with the case of issuing $ 600,000 in cashless checks. Go to the victim involved in creating a fake project.
However, the suspect, Ith Dany, still refused to come in to clarify the invitation letter of the competent authorities, trying to evade and send her representative to come in instead. This is according to the confirmation from the authorities.
According to documents obtained during the end of 2023, the suspect, Ith Dany, and her husband, a military police officer, used the names of the head of the Royal Government and the leadership of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, as well as forged various documents to create a road construction project. The fake National No. 67 is 135 kilometers long from Siem Reap province's Bakong district to Oddar Meanchey province's Anlong Veng district at a cost of $ 235 million.
Later, the victim found out that the construction project on National Road 67, which the suspect, Ith Dany, said was completely untrue, and that the check that the victim received had no cash, so the victim decided to file a lawsuit. Suspicious to the National Gendarmerie to help find justice to get back the money they lost.
The victim hopes that the National Gendarmerie under the leadership of General Sao Sokha will be able to find justice for him in the near future so that the perpetrator can not deceive the people. Innocent citizens continue.
At the same time, the victim calls on the people to be careful of this person named Ith Dany not to cheat like him by losing a lot of money and time. People and tourists like to find oysters in the mangrove forest community of O'Krosar, Kep province, in the morning, the sea water!
