The young woman, who took a day off from school to find oysters to help ease the family's livelihood, said that the time to find oysters was at low tide, from morning until about 11 a.m., when the sea began to rise. Come back.
For this method of finding snails, people can use sand shovels, and some people use sand forks. When they touch the snails, they hear the sound they know as snails. In this morning, people can find this oyster from 3 kg to 10 kg, per kilogram can sell for 40,000 to 5,000 riels.
