Senior official of the Ministry of Rural Development announces the recognition of Prasat Sambo district as the district has completed defecation
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Nuon Danhel, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Rural Development, announced the recognition of Prasat Sambo district of Kampong Thom province as the district that completed the defecation on May 3, 2023.
He added that currently, the provinces that have decided to end open defecation are 6 provinces: Svay Rieng, Prey Veng, Kandal, Kampong Speu, Kampong Chhnang and Kep, so the success in Prasat Sambo district is a good example for the experience of other districts / cities. Others must understand and consider the key to this success.
He stressed that the achievement of the province to stop blaming the open field will be the greatest pride of the whole province and in response to the vision of the Royal Government of Cambodia 2025, all people in rural communities must have adequate water supply and sanitation services. Live in a hygienic and sustainable environment.
He instructed provincial, district, commune and village leaders to monitor all forms of publicity, encourage people to build toilets, raise funds from philanthropists to support poor families who lack the ability to build toilets in order to achieve a stop. Defecate in the open air.
