His Excellency Hun Manet added that the work of helping each other in our society, the work of calling for the work of helping each other in the name of humanity is reviving well and this is a show of encouragement and now the reason for the freedom of the press and the interests of the Royal The government has guaranteed the rights and freedoms with the ability of the people to turn the spirit of wanting to help each other into a united force that can help each other in time is important.
Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet added that in the past, when Samdech saw the problem, Samdech could have an opinion, but the one who removed it was Samdech Techo Hun Sen, and most of Samdech Techo took a break at 1 or 2 o'clock, now when he saw the problem There is no choice, it must be removed by yourself, but what is important is that Samdech really does not guarantee that all information is accurate.
