* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that in the stage of digital development, every citizen has the ability to provide information. This is a larger space of information.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government needs information from all angles to solve the problem.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that in the past eight months, Samdech has solved many problems through information from the media, including the people.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that some days at 1 or 2 o'clock at night, Samdech is still following the information on social media to grasp the problems of the people and come up with solutions.
* President Hun Manet stated that information on social media, whether true or false, is also useful for the authorities to know and clarify for false information. But if the information of the problem is true, the authorities will go out and solve it.
