Samdech Samdech Hun Manet reminded the ministries and institutions not to establish their own institutes, to examine the existing institutes and strengthen them. Not always demanding to open and fall and not walk.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advises to improve the capacity of journalists through vocational training to maintain ethics and quality of work. The Ministry of Information must promote the reopening of vocational training and journalism training centers.
* Samdech Hun Manet recommends reviewing all legal and legal documents that are still in force to prepare, amend or reorganize in response to the evolution of society and to improve law enforcement in the field of journalism in order to maintain order. Of the profession properly.
