(Phnom Penh): The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathi Hun Manet, on the morning of May 2, 2024, sent a congratulatory message to Mrs. Neak Oknha Mao Chamnan, who was elected President of the Cambodian Artists Association for the sixth mandate.
