Ministry of Agriculture prepares to organize Cambodia Aquaculture Fair 2024 to jointly solve aquaculture problems and raise consumer awareness
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries will organize the Cambodia Aquaculture Exhibition 2024 to showcase the rich aquaculture yields that farmers have raised and discuss solutions to the problems faced by aquaculture.
The exhibition will bring together key stakeholders of the aquaculture value chain to jointly address aquaculture issues such as feed varieties, marketing and finance, as well as raise consumer awareness of Cambodian aquaculture products. At the same time, through this exhibition, fish products raised by farmers will be presented to the leaders and the public, students to understand the techniques and technologies of fish farming.
