Stong District Governor Orders Forces to Protect Natural Resources
He gave the strictest command to all the forces deployed here to fulfill the task of protecting the natural resources, flooded forests and fish in the three regions for the benefit of all of us and for the legacy of future generations. Such as participating in the maintenance and promotion of the environment and ecosystems.
He called on local people to join together with local authorities and the Royal Government under the wise and skillful leadership of Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in protecting natural resources for the common good.
He further emphasized and warned those who invade, forget, destroy or violate the regulations and guidelines of the Royal Government in the protection of natural resources, especially Prey Nam and flooded forest, which is the most important fish habitat. Be responsible and punished according to the law in force without exception.
