Please be informed that Khmer fresh milk comes from the efforts of research and overcoming many obstacles of the Royal Academy of Cambodia distributed in the market during October 2019. Currently, this fresh milk is being distributed in some supermarkets in Phnom Penh, and there is also delivery of orders and distribution to the provinces.
Techo Sen Russey Trup Milk is sold with the slogan "Our milk, our national product". The slogan expresses pride in the first Cambodian hand-made milk. The temperature can reach 46 degrees Celsius! Ms. O Vandin warns people to be careful and drink enough water, do not stay under the heat for too long, which leads to the body can not stand and lead to heart attack
(Phnom Penh): Dr. O Vandin, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, expressed her concern for the health of the people as the weather in Cambodia has risen to an unprecedented temperature of 46 degrees Celsius on May 1, 2024.
Dr. O Vandin, a public health expert, said that with the risk of unprecedented heat, this could have a devastating effect on people if exposed to the sun for too long, leading to skin rashes. Too much dehydration can cause the body to become unbearable, which can lead to suffocation or fainting and heart attack and death.
The following is the full statement of Ms. O Vandin:
Climate change is now a reality. Today, the heat can reach 46 degrees Celsius, which I urge our people to take great care to protect their own health properly in accordance with the guidelines of the Ministry of Health, which has already been released to the public. Mail can also be found on the ministry's Facebook page.
I would like to wish all the people good health and enjoy the entertainment on May 1, International Labor Day, and avoid the health effects due to the current heat wave. Thank you. ”
