(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) on April 30, 2024 organized a training course on the use of population statistics management software to manage polling station locations and voter registration offices for census. Names and Voter Registration 2024 to the Chiefs of Operations and Technical Officers of the 25 Capital-Provincial Election Secretariats.
The training took place throughout the day at the NEC, with a total of more than 100 participants, including officials of the NEC.
Pursuant to the Law on the National Assembly Election, the NEC shall update the voter list in the commune through the annual voter list and voter registration to ensure the quality, completeness, accuracy and completeness of the voter list. Update. Therefore, in order to achieve this, the NEC must conduct an estimated population census in villages, communes, sangkats before the voter list and voter registration process.
