(Tbong Khmum): On the morning of April 30, 2024, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan, Provincial Governor and Chairman of Tbong Khmum Provincial Administrative Unity Command, chaired a meeting of Tbong Khmum Provincial Administrative Unity Command to prevent and suppress all kinds of crimes. Basic to be effective.
The meeting was attended by the Deputy Governor, the Chief of the Provincial Court, the Provincial Police Commissioner, the Deputy Commander of the Provincial Gendarmerie, the Deputy Commander of the Provincial Operational Area, the leaders of the provincial halls, the departments around the provinces, the governors of the seven districts. District and district inspectors, post chiefs throughout the province and many stakeholders.
On that occasion, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan said, "The Municipal Administrative Unity Command is a staff member of the Provincial Administrative Command and has the duty to solve various problems that occur in their districts and report to the Administrative Command. "The province so that the provincial administrative command can receive information and report to the national level."
Dr. Chairman of the Provincial Administrative Command continued, "In the past, all Municipal Administrative Committees have participated in solving many problems and achieved good results, but there are still some issues that we need to pay attention to solve. Therefore, I would like to put out five measures to crack down as well as prevent other crimes in our Tbong Khmum province.
The provincial governor confirmed that the five measures include
First: Prevent and suppress the drug problem Second: Prevent and suppress all illegal gambling Third: Prevent and suppress all clearing and encroachment on flooded forest land 4: Prevent and reduce traffic accidents Fifth: Prevent and suppress gangsters who cause insecurity in our districts, villages, communes and provinces.
Dr. Cheam Chansophoan also indicated that the land survey in Krouch Chhmar district will be completed by the end of 2024 to prevent further encroachment on flooded forest land.
Finally, Dr. Governor mentioned the policy of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia "Clean our house", so all stakeholders must work together using total force, total measures to succeed in this work.
It should be noted that this meeting aims to review the report on the implementation of the work of the Administrative Unity Command of the 7 districts of Tbong Khmum province and strengthen the work that has been put out to be implemented.
