(Ratanakkiri): In the early morning of April 30, 2024, the Forestry Administration Force of the Mekong Inspectorate seized a jeep transporting pickled fruits with license plate number Kampong Cham 3A-4858 at the point of climbing the swing mountain about 100 meters, O'Chum District, while traveling. On National Road 78 towards Vietnam through O'Yadaw International Gate.
Mr. Tith Vy said that in order to maintain confidentiality, he did not cooperate with lower forest administration officials and relevant authorities.
In this operation, some big people in Ratanakkiri province intervened to release them so that the crime trucks could continue to travel smoothly to Vietnam. In addition to the above-mentioned jeeps transporting pickles, there is also a convoy of Samsung trucks rushing to pick up pickles to Vietnam.
