* First: Presentation on "The Process of Writing Research Articles: Perspectives from Researchers" by Dr. Un Kheang, Professor of Political Science
This series of workshops will include four orientation workshops designed to provide an orientation forum to share knowledge and experience on the doctoral writing process and research papers by senior speakers with Cambodian doctoral candidates. Currently studying at universities and researchers from various research institutions in Cambodia.
The second workshop of this series will be held in June in Battambang, while the third and fourth workshops will be held in July and September in Siem Reap and Kep.
