(Kampong Chhnang): Traffic police officers of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police continued to implement the land traffic law at various destinations in Kampong Chhnang province to disseminate and educate people about the road traffic law. We want them to understand more about traffic laws in order to effectively reduce the rate of traffic accidents throughout the province.
