This canal is a project of great importance for the national economy and a road connecting the river to the Cambodian sea through Kandal province as well. The project will benefit the transportation of agricultural products, trade, irrigation, tourism, flood relief and many other benefits. At the same time, all citizens, civil servants and armed forces in Lvea Em district congratulated and fully supported the implementation of this canal project.
