Samdech President Hun Manet thanked the Cambodian people, both inside and outside the country, for sending out many messages in support of the Funan-Techo Prek Chik project for Cambodia. Samdech Thipadei will continue Samdech Techo's mission to make Funan-Techo canal dive.
According to the President, the construction of the Funan-Techo canal is a historical responsibility for the leadership, so there is a very clear study of the impact. According to the law, the digging of Funan-Techo canal does not require Cambodia to apply for a law from any country, only to provide information to the Mekong River Commission.
Samdech Hun Sen also said that many countries that build canals and dams do not care about Cambodia, but Samdech claimed that nothing came to stop the Funan-Techo canal project. Samdech Hun Sen stated that the Funan-Techo canal project has been studied in detail for about 26 months.
Please be informed that Prek Chik Funan-Techo project with a length of about 180 kilometers connecting the waterway between the river and the sea of Cambodia is a project that has great benefits for Cambodia. This project is supported by the Cambodian people, both inside and outside the country, even if the Cambodians tend to oppose the Royal Government of Cambodia living abroad.
However, Cambodia's historic canal project has been criticized by some Vietnamese researchers and accused of serving the Chinese military. Initially, it was thought that only Vietnam opposed the project and tried to paint a link to China's military geography to thwart the project because it was detrimental to its economic interests.
Suddenly, on the morning of Thursday, April 25, 2024, they also saw Mr. Sam Rainsy, an opposition politician in Cambodia living in France, escaping the law of Cambodia, also came out to oppose this project. Sam Rainsy also painted the project like a Vietnamese researcher, saying that the project serves the Chinese military.
At the same time, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that do not care who does it and do not be afraid to popularize Samdech Techo or Samdech Thipdey is important for the benefit of all Cambodians.
He said that the budget for the construction of the Funan-Techo canal is ready and does not require funding from the people. Spiritual support is huge as the Royal Government has no plans to raise funds for the construction of the Funan-Techo Canal.
Samdech Hun Manet said that even without the participation of foreigners, Cambodia can build this canal, and the construction site of Funan-Techo canal may open at the end of 2024, if the longest is in 2025. In addition, Samdech Thipdey called on Cambodians of all faiths and religions to support the success of the Prek Chun Funan-Techo project.
Samdech President Hun Manet also said that some people took the spirit of nationalism to divide the nation, but now the Khmer people take the spirit of nationalism to build the Funan-Techo canal as a national achievement.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen has stated that the Funan-Techo canal is a purely socio-economic benefit that helps Cambodia in the southwest to have waterways to the sea in addition to the existing Mekong River transport routes. This canal helps the people in this canal to have water to use for growing crops, to help relieve floods during the rainy season, to increase freshwater fish production in this canal, etc.
Samdech Techo also stated that this canal does not affect the flow of the Mekong River, because this canal does not connect from the Mekong River, but from the Bassac River, and on the other hand, there is a sluice gate to prevent fresh water from falling. Into the sea.
Samdech Hun Manet had previously claimed that the canal project did not serve China's military geography. According to the President, the Cambodian Constitution does not allow the presence of foreign troops on Cambodian territory, and in addition, the technical canal dug with a water depth of 4 to 5 meters can not allow naval vessels to travel.
