Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many added that in recent years, the automotive sector in Cambodia has grown significantly, while in the past, there were few car importers in Cambodia, there will be no car assembly companies at all. Currently, there is a steady increase in the number of car importers, and some companies are also doing car assembly business in Cambodia.
