Permanent Deputy Prime Minister Vongsey Visoth recommends 7 points to the Cambodian Duke Association
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Deputy Prime Minister in charge of the Office of the Council of Ministers, made seven recommendations to the Cambodian Duke Association, which is recognized as a partner of the Royal Government in contributing to the socio-economic development of Cambodia.
The recommendation and request for the cooperation of the Deputy Prime Minister was made on the occasion of his participation as the representative of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia in the "Closing Ceremony of the First Meeting 2023 and the direction of the 2024 plan" of the Association. Duke of Cambodia, held on March 26, 2024 at the Garden City Hotel.
Observing the important role and function of the Cambodian Duke Association and as the Chairman of the Inter-Ministerial Commission to review and evaluate the request for honor and termination of the Duke, Permanent Deputy Prime Minister Vongsey Visoth provided some recommendations and requested cooperation. From the Cambodian Duke Association as follows:
* 1: All dignitaries must respect the Constitution, laws and legal documents of the Kingdom of Cambodia, adhere to good morals, engage in legal business and avoid any activities that harm the honor and dignity of the duke.
* 2: Honorable movement, which is a member of the Association to participate more activities in the development and nation-building, including the donation of funds and the donation of resources, property, facilities to the state, the construction of physical infrastructure, including Such as roads, bridges, schools, hospitals, irrigation systems, pagodas, public buildings.
* 5: The Cambodian Duke Association must plan social and charitable activities, especially accelerate the establishment of the Cambodian Duke Association fund by ensuring that all members have the opportunity to participate in those activities and have many beneficiaries from all walks of life to promote The potential and prestige of the association.
* 6: The Cambodian Duke Association must establish a mechanism and have a clear program to promote both competition and partnership in the market, trade activities and domestic investment and attract foreign investment to Cambodia.
* 7: The Cambodian Duke Association should continue to cooperate more actively with the Royal Government to participate in improving the business environment and building an environment that is attractive and conducive to business activities to promote sustainable economic growth and environment.
The Permanent Deputy Prime Minister added that the successful organization and operation of the first meeting of the Cambodian Duke Association at this time is an important milestone that reflects the excellence and proud progress of community building and organization. Duke, which is the initiative of Duke Ly Yong Phat and has been becoming an important pillar in the development and nation building.
