While announcing the search for support from people from all walks of life to become a national movement, Samdech Techo Hun Sen explained that the Funan-Techo canal provides direct transportation to the sea without crossing the country. Other. The Funan-Techo Canal project is not only growing in the southwest, but throughout the country. Agricultural products in the provinces will be able to be transported through this canal.
Samdech Techo, President of the Senate, also claimed that the Funan-Techo canal project makes Cambodian goods without having to go through Vietnam without having to pay extra when passing through Vietnam. Samdech hopes that the Vietnamese leaders will understand what he is saying now.
According to Samdech Techo, in addition to facilitating the transportation of Prek Chik Funan-Techo, it will also be a source of water supply in the southwestern provinces, and Prek Chik Funan-Techo will help relieve floods in the provinces. Southwest as well.
