Deputy Prime Minister Vongsey Visoth expressed his congratulations and high appreciation to the Cambodian Duke Association, which has continued to grow from 32 members at the end of 2022 to 365 members by April 20, 2024. . In particular, many achievements have been made for the society through cooperation with the Royal Government in promoting the socio-economic prestige of Cambodia and participation in various social activities.
The Cambodian Duke Association was placed under the technical governance of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as its honorary chairman.
The Cambodian Duke Association has a vision to maintain and promote the noble excellence of the Duke by participating in the sustainable social and economic development of Cambodia and the environment to create peace, harmony and improvement in the living standards of the people as well as Developed countries.
