The following is a message of thanks from Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many gave a presentation on "Innovative Leadership and Merit in Public Administration" at the 7 January Palace
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Public Works and Member of the Standing Committee of the Central Committee, gave a presentation on "Leadership, Innovation and Merit in Public Administration".
This presentation took place on the afternoon of April 25, 2024, as part of the political education course of the Cambodian People's Party, Level 2, 9th generation, with participants who are party officials from parties, ministries, institutions, capitals and provinces. And a total of 138 party youth organizations participated in the 7 Makara Palace in Phnom Penh.
In his introductory speech, Deputy Prime Minister Hun Many divided the content into two parts: information on the progress of the public service sector, including the work of public administration reform in the seventh mandate, and the main content around the leadership, as well as the heroism of the elites in Reform and promote public administration.
Mr. HUN Many emphasized on the implementation of key measures of the Royal Government of the 7th mandate, especially the competition for the recruitment of civil servants, which is gaining popularity and popularity from the masses, the analysis of the functions of ministries and institutions, and the system. Motivation to support achievements.
Please be informed that the Level 2 Party Political Education Course has been invited by many senior Cambodian dignitaries to provide wisdom and knowledge as well as the experiences that the speakers have had in the past on the leadership aspect of Management of state work, party work and public society to all participants.
