* President Hun Manet stated that "new waves push the front waves" is a natural law. Senior artists are not only the leading wave, but also the experienced and exemplary characters of the next generation to the younger generation. In this sense, helping to train, transfer knowledge and motivate young people is an obligation to continue to preserve our ancestral heritage and the continued growth of our arts and culture.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet requested the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts to correct and correct any mistakes as well as to orient and point out the behaviors that should be taken for the sake of dignity and prevent the eventual impact on the traditional arts and culture.
