At the same time, Dr. Chhim Khin Dareth urged all representatives of ministries, institutions and sub-national level to raise the budget to support the national policy to end AIDS and the sustainability of the AIDS program for 2023-2028.
(Preah Sihanouk): Residents of Keo Phos Commune, Stung Hav District, Preah Sihanouk Province will receive the achievement of a 200-meter-long concrete road as a commune fund project in 2024, which opened the auction on the morning of April 24, 2024. At the meeting hall of Keo Phos commune hall.
The bidding meeting was chaired by Mr. Eng Chamroeun, Deputy Director of Planning and Investment of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Hall, represented by Mr. Kheang Phearum, Mr. Pheng Ming, Keo Phos Commune Chief and attended by the Provincial Technical Working Group, Commune Procurement Committee. The construction company, as well as many journalists, the bidding meeting went smoothly, in accordance with the procedure and with transparency.
After the transparent bidding, the result was a concrete road 200 meters long, 6 meters wide and 0.15 meters thick, with an estimated cost of 120,999,900 Riels after submitting the project bid to the company. Leng Malys, including 4 companies participated in the bidding.
After the opening ceremony, the Deputy Director of the Provincial Investment Planning Office said that in order to solve the difficulties for local people, the Commune / Sangkat Development Fund 2024 project has launched a series of bidding processes in communes throughout Sihanoukville. Also completed the project and achieved many concrete roads in the past.
Mr. Eng Chamroeun emphasized that after receiving the successful bid, he instructed all companies to build the road according to the design standards to be good and durable for the people and ask the local authorities. Sangkats need to address the impacts of the people peacefully so that the process of road construction can run smoothly and quickly so that the people can use it in a timely manner.
Mr. Pheng Ming said that when the project starts, it will inevitably affect the interests of the people, but as the head of the commune procurement team, he will explain to the people the impact not to be offended. Get a clean road, easy to travel, of course, we have to give up a few crops, stone pillars, fences and all the impacts that are affected.
