The declaration of friendship and solidarity was made during the 14th Summit between the Cambodian People's Party and the Lao People's Revolutionary Party at the 7 January Palace, the headquarters of the Cambodian People's Party.
According to a press release issued by the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), the meeting was held in a warm, friendly, understanding and trusting atmosphere in order to continue to cultivate solidarity, traditional friendship and cooperation in all fields between the party and Both countries to deepen and bear fruit.
The two sides highly appreciated and commended the steady development of traditional solidarity, friendship and cooperation between the two countries, which has raised the level of comprehensive strategic partnership and cooperation. Long lasting.
In addition, the two sides exchanged information on the overall situation in the region and internationally, the emerging situation of each party and country, bilateral relations and cooperation in the regional and international framework, as well as the direction of cooperation. Transactions between the two parties.
During the meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Secretary-General of the Lao People's Democratic Party and all Lao leaders for sending congratulatory messages to the Cambodian People's Party on its victory in the Senate election and congratulating Samdech Techo on his victory. Elected President of the Senate for the 5th term.
The two sides agreed to continue to strengthen the friendship, solidarity and cooperation between the two parties and the two countries, as well as the three countries, Cambodia, Laos and Vietnam, for the national interests of the three countries and the people of the two countries. Each contributes to the cause of peace, stability, friendship, cooperation and development in the Mekong subregion, as well as regionally and globally.
The two sides agreed to hold the 15th summit in the Lao People's Democratic Republic in 2025.
Not only within the framework of the political parties leading the country, within the framework of the states and states, Cambodia and Laos have also announced the continuation of better relations and cooperation. Maintain strong ties of friendship and solidarity as a fenced country.
