In the condolence letter, it was written that on behalf of the leadership, staff, officers, deputies and all the soldiers, and myself, I am extremely shocked to learn that Major General Seng Samnang, Deputy Chief of Staff, Her husband, Lok Chumteav, passed away at 10:22 a.m. on Wednesday, the 1st of Roach Khech, the year of Rong Chhasak. 2567 is on April 24, 2024 at the age of 60 due to illness.
In this sad time, we would like to express our deepest condolences and deepest condolences to the death of Major General Seng Samnang, the loss of our beloved husband, father, father-in-law and grandfather. Vihear Thom is also the loss of human capital in the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, who have contributed to all kinds of sacrifices with a strong will and conscience and have sacrificed their physical, mental and intellectual strength in the cause of the motherland.
We would like to dedicate our prayers to the soul of Major General Seng Samnang, who was born in death, not to be buried.
