More than 22 million Riel Social Security Budget and Precious Gift from Samdech Hun Sen Presented to the Families of Two Veterans in Stung Sen City
(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association of Kampong Thom Province, together with the leadership of the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation of Kampong Thom Province, this morning, April 24, 2024, brought 22,195 social insurance budgets. 200 Riels and precious gifts from Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet and Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony to support the families of two veterans in Stung Sen City.
The families of the two veterans received more than 11 million riels and 25 kilograms of rice, 1 box of noodles, 1 can of fish sauce, 1 can of soy sauce and 1 can of canned fish.
Mr. CHUON Seilavuth, Branch Manager of Social Assistance Fund of Kampong Thom Provincial Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, informed the families of the veterans about the social insurance budget that each family must receive according to the rank and seniority of each veteran. And the social security budget that is being handed over now is a consideration from the head of the Cambodian government.
On that occasion, Major General Som Sun expressed his condolences for the loss of the lives of the veterans who had done meritorious deeds for the motherland and the people, and prayed for the souls of the veterans to go to their deaths. .
