(Phnom Penh): Mr. Peng Po Na, Minister of Public Works and Transport, on April 23, 2024, continued to chair a bilateral meeting between the inter-ministerial working group to promote the development of railways in Cambodia and the delegation of the National Commission for Development and Reform. Form of the People's Republic of China (NDRC) led by Ms. Zhang Jianhua, Deputy Director General of the Department of Foreign Investment.
