(Phnom Penh): The Deputy Bailiff of the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Court, La Bun Hourn, was immediately transferred by the Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Justice, Keut Rith, from the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Court to work in the Bailiff Department of the Ministry of Justice immediately.
