Police arrest Chuon Kunthea for announcing the distribution of state land to people in Ta Sal commune, Oral district, Kampong Speu province
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of April 23, 2024, the police arrested Mr. Chuon Kunthea by order of the Kampong Speu Provincial Prosecutor's Office regarding the distribution of state land to the people in Ta Sal commune, Oral district, Kampong Speu province.
After receiving the order of the Prosecutor on April 23, 2024 at 14:25, the Phnom Penh Municipal Police in cooperation with the Kampong Speu Provincial Police arrested Chuon Kunthea at Mlup Chompou Tracheak Chet Restaurant, Street 1972, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
It should be noted that on April 21, 2024, the Oral District Administration completely denied the information that a person named "Chuon Kunthea" distributed land to poor people in Rong Masin village and Trapeang Thmear village, Ta Sal commune, Oral district, Kampong Speu province.
The refusal follows a notice from Chuon Kunthea, who claimed that he would cut off a plot of land for poor people in Kampong Speu province to build a house or enjoy in Rong Masin village, Ta Sal commune, Oral district.
The district administration calls on the public to purchase land in the Oral district to purchase land with legal titles, to avoid buying and selling land of unknown origin, especially land within protected areas and public lands of other states. If you have any questions, please contact us at 09775050477.
