A video clip shared online shows several military helicopters flying at low altitudes as a rule at Lumut Naval Base as it is a pre-event rehearsal for the Malaysian Navy. Held next May. During that time, two helicopters collided, causing them to lose their balance and fall to the ground. After the incident, all 10 victims were confirmed dead.
