(Kratie): Another baby dolphin was found in Prek Kampi dolphin canyon, Chroy Banteay village, Chroy Banteay commune, Prey Prosop district, Kratie province.
The Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries said that the newborn dolphin was spotted by the research team of the Fisheries Administration and WWF at 15:10 on April 22, 2024. This baby dolphin is in the group of three other large dolphins.
Please be informed that this is the seventh baby dolphin born in the beginning of 2024. The Fisheries Administration of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries would like to thank the river guards, local authorities and the people for their care and protection of their valuable fishery resources.
