(Kampong Chhnang): Mr. Chhay Rithi Sen, Minister of Rural Development, on April 22, 2024, led a delegation and professional officers of the Department of Rural Water Supply of the Ministry of Rural Development to inspect the water supply source for the people living in Teuk Phos district and Samaki Meanchey District, Kampong Chhnang Province.
In Teuk Phos district, the Minister inspected the condition of two pump wells and one dry community pond in Kraing Ska commune and another community pond in Kork Rak in Kdol Sen Chey commune.
After that, the Minister continued to inspect the condition of water supply sources for the community, including drainage wells, pump wells and giant rainwater storage jars at the backs of houses of people living in four other communes: Khna Chhmar commune, Sethy commune. Svay and Chhean Leung commune, Samaki Meanchey district.
