According to the spokesperson, for March 22, 2024, traffic police nationwide inspected and fined a total of 4,769 vehicles, including 3,526 motorcycles and 1,243 vehicles.
Noted offenses for motorcycles include: drunken helmets, drug addicts, firearms / badges, etc. The vehicles include: drunken driving, heavy goods, speeding, drunken driving without a license and lights.
