(Bangkok, Thailand): On April 22, 2024, on behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Dr. Ly Thuch, Senior Minister and Chairman of the National Committee for ESCAP, chaired a Ministerial Plenary Meeting on "Using Digital Innovation for Sustainable Development." Asia and the Pacific ”of the 80th Annual Meeting of the United Nations Economic and Social Commission for Asia and the Pacific (UNESCAP).
