Fire of jealousy! Man kills ex-wife, hangs himself in Pursat province's Kandeang district
(Pursat): A 64-year-old man killed his 55-year-old ex-wife and hanged himself in the same house due to jealousy. This incident happened on the morning of April 22, 2024 at a house in Kanhy Bay Dach village, Anlong Vil commune, Kandieng district, Pursat province.
According to a report from the Pursat Provincial Police, the man was identified as Heng Khom, 64, while his ex-wife Ieng Chakrya, 55. Authorities confirmed that the two were already divorced, but lived under the same roof, and the reason for the murder was because someone was angry with the ex-wife.
After the competent experts and the forensic doctor at the provincial level, the body was handed over to the daughter of the deceased for a traditional ceremony and further research on this case.
