Ministry of Economy and Finance Continues Training Campaign on Public Financial Management to Commune / Sangkat Administrative Financial Assistant
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Economy and Finance on the morning of April 22, 2024, opened a training course on "Public Financial Management in Commune / Sangkat Administration" to 169 Commune / Sangkat Administrative Finance Assistants from Kampong Speu and Provinces. Kampong Thom to strengthen professional capacity and raise awareness related to public financial management.
The event was led by Dr. Hean Sahip, Secretary of State and Chairman of the Capacity Building Working Group of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, and with the participation of the Under Secretary of State, the leadership of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Governor of Kampong Speu Province. , Deputy Governor of Kampong Thom Provincial Board of Governors, as well as lecturers, trainees and relevant professional officers.
During the ceremony, the Governor of Kampong Speu Province stated that for the past two years, the Commune / Sangkat Administration has provided financial assistance to the Commune / Sangkat Chiefs in the preparation of financial reports, planning and annual budgets.
The provincial governor stated that although the commune / sangkat administrative financial assistants were selected through the examination, the results of past work show that the officers still do not have sufficient knowledge and experience in the work of commune / sangkat administration and above. Technical aspects of public accounting and budgeting are still required, which requires further training.
The Secretary of State stated that the Ministry of Economy and Finance has focused on building and developing the capacity of public finance officers and has launched a strategic plan on capacity building and development within the framework of the management reform program. Public Finance Phase 4: Orientation, training and capacity building for public finance officers of ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations.
