(Phnom Penh): A man committed suicide by jumping under the wheel of a container truck that was driving on the road and was crushed by the truck, causing his head to break and he died on the spot. Unbeknownst to him, the car then drove on for more than 100 meters, then stopped and the driver fled.
The incident happened at 4:35 pm on April 21, 2024 on National Road 4 in Prey Pring North Village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Surveillance cameras at the scene showed that the incident was not a traffic accident, but a suicide. Before the accident, the car was seen driving from east to west. When he arrived at the scene, the man ran towards the car and jumped under the rear wheel of the car, causing his head to break and he died on the spot.
