Ministry of Water Resources announces weather conditions in Cambodia for April 21, 2024
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a notification on the weather situation in Cambodia for April 21, 2024.
Low pressure area over the Gulf of Thailand, the Kingdom of Cambodia, the central Mekong Basin and the South China Sea will be affected from April 21 to 23, 2024, the ministry said.
