Samdech Techo reminded that Samdech donated about $ 100,000 to treat the professor two months ago. But perhaps a serious medical condition could not help him.
Samdech Techo shares his deepest condolences and condolences to the family of the late Professor Sambo Manara, Professor of History.
Samdech Techo considers the death of the professor not only the loss of a pious husband, father, grandfather, wife, children and grandchildren, but also the loss of the most valuable human resources for the whole Cambodian society. .
Samdech Techo also highlighted that even though the professor is now far away, the words of education, advice, teaching, wisdom, heroism and great sacrifices throughout his life in the cause of the motherland are still engraved in the heart and memory of Every Cambodian youth forever.
Samdech Techo, President of the Senate, thanked the Professor for assisting Samdech and Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, as advisors to the Prime Minister.
Please be informed that Professor of History, Mr. Sambo Manara, passed away this morning, Saturday, April 20, 2024, at the age of 67 due to a disease.
The death of a professor is the loss of a great historical human resource. As a professor, he left a legacy of enlightenment to many Cambodians.
The body of Professor Sambo Manara is kept for a traditional Buddhist ceremony at No. 1, Street 5A, Sangkat Sambour, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
