Mr. HUN Many considered the meeting as an important principle of the party and as a basis for implementing internal unity through directing, monitoring and listening to live reports.
(Kampong Speu): On April 20, 2024, Mr. HUN Many, Chairman of Kampong Speu Provincial Party Working Group, chaired a meeting with the working group of district and commune party committees of Oral and Thpong districts to monitor the progress of work and listen to suggestions. Blessings as well as challenges that the team faces at party headquarters.
To begin with, he allowed the chairman of the district party committee to report on the status of the party's work and highlight the progress as well as the challenges and requests, especially the implementation of the joint plan towards the Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District and Khan Council elections. May 26, 2024 in the near future.
He then provided an opportunity for the chairman of the commune party committee and the party working group to visit the commune to share opinions, experiences and raise issues.
After listening to the report, Mr. HUN Many sent a message of thanks and thanks from the party president to the working group and the district party. At the same time, he thanked the leaders of the working groups of the district and commune party committees of the two districts for taking the time to attend the busy meeting to report, give opinions and share experiences to the meeting.
Mr. Hun Many claimed that "the meeting is an important principle of the party and the basis for the implementation of internal unity through directing, monitoring and listening to the report."
