(Tbong Khmum): Memot District Authority held a meeting to compile the history of Hong Waterfall Resort to prepare this natural waterfall area to become a standard tourist area for Tbong Khmum Province, located in Kapan Commune, Memot District, Tbong Khmum Province.
This meeting was held at Memot District Hall on April 19, 2024 in the presence of Memot District Governor, Chairman of District Council, Chairman-Deputy Chairman of 3 specialized departments, including: Department of Culture, Department of Information and Department of Tourism and Deputy Governor. District officials, district chiefs, commune chiefs, elders, elders and many stakeholders.
Mr. Sreng Ly also said that the preparation of the natural waterfall requires the participation of provincial leaders, districts, people in this area and the support of all institutions, departments, relevant ministries, especially the Royal Government.
Please be informed that Hong Waterfall Resort is a natural resort located in Lok village, Kampang commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province.
Tourists often come to see the real scenery and swim and play with the speed of the water. Guests often went there to pray to the Buddha statue and to seek blessings from the monks who lived there.
According to local authorities, the 1,800-hectare waterfall is densely forested, with large and small trees, vines, tassels, and natural rhizomes, worthy of the tranquility of nature. Need to relax, bathe, play with natural waterfalls will make tourists create countless memories when visiting here.
