"Malaysia is deeply concerned and disappointed by the implementation of the United Nations Security Council (UNSC) veto power on 18 April 2024 to prevent Palestine from becoming a full member," the statement said. "The United Nations, despite calls from most countries."
The statement added that Malaysia will continue to support the Palestinian cause.
