(Phnom Penh): The murder that happened at 3:30 pm on April 18, 2024 at the point of house No. 31, Street 36, Borey Chhouk Va 2, Tek Panha village, Sangkat Samrong Krom, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh, caused by a man One of them stabbed the victim to death in the house, starting from a love story.
The killer was angry and accused the victim of concealing the story of her husband and having children without telling him to betray her trust in love. Lim Kineth, 25, a resident of Prek Chik village, Tonle Bit commune, Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum province, was a laborer working in Thailand and was taken to a Russian hospital. He also uses drugs.
The victim, 24-year-old Meas Leakena, and her husband, 37-year-old Hua Sin, are Chinese and work for a stone grinding company in Kampong Speu province. The victim and her husband stayed in the house and had two sons in the family.
The assailant also admitted that before killing her, the victim found out that she was married and had children and hid his body, cheating on the trust he was trying to love. At that time, he was very angry and investigated the whereabouts of the victim. He then left Thailand, and when he arrived in Cambodia, he rented a taxi to the victim's house and killed her and then killed himself.
