Once the procedural complaint is resolved, the NEC must validate the official voter list. The official voter list cannot be changed unless one of the voters on the voter list dies. In this case, the Ministry of Interior must complete the change of members of the Commune / Sangkat Council at least 7 (seven) days before the election day for the NEC to replace in the official voter list.
