Samdech Hun Sen also highly appreciated the achievements and training and training of the National Defense University, in particular and in general, the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces. While the National Defense University has the role of training senior officers to ensure the training of the army, the most important thing is to pay attention to the training units, and especially to all the army training schools.
"National Defense is a work in progress and an important duty of all of us, especially the Armed Forces, and the core of the defense capacity is the quality of "Human resources."
"In order to ensure the quality and capacity of officers, we need to pay attention to the training and retraining of officers at all levels, both in terms of tactics, campaigns and strategies. Understand both tactics and politics. This is the additional statement of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet.
"Reform in the field of defense is not an easy task, but we must succeed without backing down," he said. Therefore, in order to strengthen the capacity of officers on defense, we must focus on training.
Samdech Hun Manet stated that the divisive situation and the war in the past led to Cambodia's large number of soldiers and advised to consider the selection of officers and soldiers to respond to the social situation.
Samdech Hun Manet added that in order to strengthen the national defense, the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces must be a strong force, full capacity, strong will, conscience and good discipline, strong defense of national independence, sovereignty, territorial integrity, security, social order in all circumstances to defeat all tactics. And the actions of hostile forces, both inside and outside the country.
It should be noted that the National Defense University is a higher education institution of the Ministry of National Defense, studying security situation analysis, assessing threats to national security, national defense policy, border protection, national security, military reform, participation in the defense sector. And International Security, studying military science, social science, real science and foreign languages for the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
The National Defense University is responsible for training and retraining senior officers, officers, professional officers and specialized officers to become competent and qualified officers of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in researching, analyzing and evaluating the implementation of measures. Strategy, defense policy, and performance of duties as an officer, commander, and chief of staff.
