Last weekend, Iran fired more than 300 missiles and drones at Israel in retaliation for an Israeli attack on the Iranian consulate in Damascus, Syria, killing seven people, including two Iranian generals. . The attack did not cause any major damage and most of Iran's missiles and drones were shot down by Israeli forces with the help of US and regional partners.
Iran has also warned of greater retaliation if Israel dares to provoke or launch a retaliatory attack on Iran.
Director General of the Insurance Regulator: Currently, Cambodia has 41 insurance companies with an investment of about $ 500 million (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Mr. Bou Chanpirou, Director General of the Insurance Regulator of Cambodia, confirmed that Cambodia currently has a number of insurance companies. 40 companies with all levels, both international and global, with an investment of about 500 million US dollars.
He said that buying insurance services is not the same as buying goods by giving money immediately, the purchase of insurance is the purchase of a contract to protect against risk.
"Purchasing insurance is not the same as buying anything else, giving money immediately, buying insurance is a contract purchase, which means that when an accident occurs we can "Compensation, but we have already paid the purchase price in advance, so the general contract can last up to 15 years."
