The Ministry of Environment plans to establish a green recreation corridor in Preah Jayavarman-Norodom National Park "Phnom Kulen"
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Environment has received support and cooperation with stakeholders to improve the livelihoods of the protected area community in Preah Jayavarman-Norodom "Phnom Kulen" National Park to become a small businessman by establishing a green recreation corridor. Which is an appropriate occupation option in the region that reduces the pressure on natural resources.
It should be noted that in accordance with the "Pentagon Strategy" Phase 1 and based on the "Environmental Chakra Strategy" 2023-2028 and the direct guidance of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia introduced the designation of Jayavarman National Park - Norodom "Phnom Kulen" is a natural tourist destination.
At the same time, in Preah Jayavarman-Norodom National Park, "Phnom Kulen, the Ministry of Environment has organized a total of 5 community protected areas, including 1. Prey Thom Anlong Thom Protected Area Community 2. Prey Thom Popel Nature Reserve Community 3. Phnom Ktouch Forest Protected Area Community 4. Community of Phnom Phnom Pineas Protected Area and 5. Chub Ta Sok Protected Area Community. ”
