Samdech Hun Sen - Prime Minister of Cambodia Hun Sen instructs the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) to consider the recruitment of officers and soldiers (Video inside) (Phnom Penh) Soldiers clearly to respond to the social situation, especially to consider the composition of the relationship between officers, lieutenants and soldiers to maintain balance in the army for 15 or 20 years.
This instruction was held for the inauguration ceremony of the co-educational building, the dormitory building and the canteen building, accompanied by the closing ceremony of the training and training course for 2023 and the opening ceremony for the course for 2024 at the National Defense University, which took place on the morning of the 19th April 2024.
On that occasion, Samdech President spoke about the recruitment of troops and training - training at the three officers' academy and sending to study abroad. At this point, the prince wants the relevant expert committee to consider the composition of the recruitment of soldiers, how many soldiers are there, including the percentage of soldiers, the percentage of lieutenants, the percentage of officers? Consider for 15 or 20 years to maintain balance.
Samdech continued that the officers in Cambodia were all involved in the situation where the country was at war to end the war, however, did not cause Cambodia to lose its ability to defend itself, but in the future, the command must be balanced to make it easier Prepare to lead and command the army.
The Prime Minister recommended that "the recruitment of soldiers, deputies and officers in the future should follow the formula of duty soldiers, because the duty soldiers, they will have a reasonable period of time to consider their careers and have "Clarity in pursuing a military career and also reducing the rate of leaving the army."
Samdech President Hun Manet: The situation of division and war in the past led to Cambodia has many officers (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, said that the situation of division and war in the past became the reason why Cambodia has more officers Because to end the war, there must be integration, organization and maintenance of forces.
Speaking on the occasion of inaugurating the achievements and closing the training course at the National Defense University on the morning of April 19, 2024, Samdech Dhipdey also expressed his intention to strike a balance between officers and soldiers in the future. According to the statement of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet, in order to include the soldiers in the future, about a large part of the soldiers must enter through the duty gate.
On that occasion, Samdech Hun Sen also said that national defense is a regular task and the force is the core force on national defense. At the same time, the selection, promotion and promotion must be carried out in accordance with the principle of "meritocracy" based on the position and the general statute for the soldiers of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
Samdech Hun Sen Manet also stated that the performance of military duties at all levels of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces must implement and adhere to the "mirror, bathe, scrub, treat and operate" approach. Commanders at all levels must take measures to assign, disseminate, manage and listen to the soldiers' minds in order to make timely adjustments.
