(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on April 13, 2024 issued a press release stating that on April 12, 2024, there was a case of dirty water flowing into the sea near Public Bathroom No. 1. At Ochheuteal Beach, Village 4, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province.
In the past, the provincial administration has built a drainage dam at O Sdech Suek to capture wastewater and send it to the third wastewater treatment plant for pre-drainage treatment, and has a drainage system separated from the dam to capture water. Overflow during the rainy season is dumped into the sea to reduce the load of the third wastewater treatment plant.
Please note that the water has not reached the dam yet, but there is already dirty water at the bottom of the sewer, which we have not found the exact cause. For the above case, the provincial administration has sent professional officers to search for specific reasons to find effective solutions.
Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia, through the National Committee for Coastal Management and Development of Cambodia, has built and put into operation 3 wastewater treatment plants in Sihanoukville, the first station has a treatment capacity of 5,200 m3 / day. The second station has a treatment capacity of 7,200 m3 / day and the third station has a treatment capacity of 20,000 m3 / day.
In addition to the three wastewater treatment plants in Sihanoukville, there are seven other wastewater pumping stations, four of which were built by the National Committee for Coastal Management and Development of Cambodia and three by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. Delivered to pump wastewater and drop it to Sihanoukville Wastewater Treatment Station.
Although Sihanoukville already has three wastewater treatment plants and seven wastewater pumping stations, it is still not commensurate with the daily wastewater discharge needs.
Meanwhile, the Royal Government of Cambodia, together with the relevant ministries and institutions, together with the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, has been studying the possibility of constructing additional wastewater treatment plants and packing all the wastewater to be sent to the wastewater treatment plant for wastewater treatment. To become clean water in accordance with environmental standards before being released into the sea.
