(Phnom Penh): A fire broke out at an international market house selling a large amount of Chinese construction materials, causing complete damage to the upper floor. This incident caused a surprise to the people and the authorities called the fire truck to intervene and spray water at 2:40 pm on April 12, 2024 along Hanoi Street, Oknha Veang Village, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok. .
Colonel Prohm Yorn, director of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Fire Prevention and Rescue Office, told Fresh News that in accordance with the order of Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin, Deputy National Police Commissioner and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner. Instruct the specialized force of the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Office to pay close attention to the rescue operation in a timely manner.
On the orders of Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin, Lt. Col. Prohm Yorn, Director of the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, directed the fire brigade stationed at all targets to intervene. Spray water on time to prevent the fire from spreading to nearby houses.
In the above operation, the competent force used 9 fire trucks, including 9 fire trucks of the Phnom Penh Municipal Office, using 4 trucks of water and 12 cubic meters.
Colonel Prohm Yorn also confirmed that the fire was caused by an electric shock that caused the fire. In it, no one was injured and the lives of the people were not affected.
