(Tbong Khmum): In the morning of April 11, 2024, at Tbong Khmum Provincial Hall, Dr. O Vandin, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Health, and Mr. Hok Pich Hoang, Deputy Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, represented by Dr. Cheam Chan Sophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province. Dissemination meeting on the implementation framework to promote primary health care in Tbong Khmum province.
