The Secretary of State stressed that this work requires the strict implementation of the role of the five core tasks, including:
* First: Empowerment and participation of individuals, families and communities * Second: Re-orientation of health services * Third: Strengthening training capacity * Fourth: Strengthening drug management * Fifth: Maintenance of medical equipment and governance and management work.
Please be informed that for 2 days from April 10 to 11, 2024, Dr. O Vandin, Secretary of State and Dr. Keo Vannak, Director of the Provincial Health Department inspected the situation and visited health officials at 10 health centers. In Tbong Khmum and Krouch Chhmar districts, the health work results were also very good.
