(Kampong Chhnang): A dispute over the location of a burial ground at Tuol Ta Chea point in Svay Koy village, Punley commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province, which is a controversial case and has been filed in court for many years now. This morning, April 11, 2024, under the guidance and coordination of the Deputy Prosecutor of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Court.
