In fact, on April 11, 2024, the new office building of the Electricity Authority of Cambodia will be officially inaugurated under the presidency of Mr. Keo Rattanak, Minister of Mines and Energy and with the participation of the leaders of the Ministry of Mines and Energy and former The President of the Electricity Authority of Cambodia and many other officials are located in Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
