(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Thursday, April 11, 2024, Samdech Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, President of the National Council of the United Front for the Development of Motherland of Cambodia, led a delegation of repatriates after a visit to Laos and attended three Front Meeting meetings. Cambodia, Laos, Vietnam, which Laos has hosted in Vientiane for the past three days, has been fruitful.
At the same time, the leaders of the three fronts signed a Memorandum of Understanding on the Cooperation Program between the United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia, the Central Committee of the Lao National Development Front and the Central Committee of the Vietnam Fatherland Front, phase 2023-2026. :
* First: Education, dissemination and information * Second: Promote and encourage all cooperation activities at the local level * Third: Celebrate and celebrate the National Day and the anniversary of diplomatic relations of the three countries * Fourth: Organizing conferences and exchange visits * Fifth: Encouraging and encouraging all cooperation activities of the three countries * Sixth: Contributing to the building of the ASEAN Community.
