His Excellency Dr. Men Sam An said that the relationship between Cambodia and Laos has been nurtured by the leaders of the two countries in all generations and has reached the level of long-term strategic partnership.
He said that good relations between the two countries not only create harmony between nations and villages, but also bring prosperity, social stability and strengthen the principle of pluralism to the region and the world. .
