Preah Vihear Provincial Governor will strengthen good relations between journalists and provincial administrations, departments and units around the province, as well as municipal, district, commune and sangkat administrations.
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Kim Rithy, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, said that he will strengthen the good relationship between journalists and the provincial administration, between the journalists and the departments around the province, between the journalists and the municipal, district, commune and sangkat administration.
Remarks by the Governor of Preah Vihear Province during a meeting with journalists in Preah Vihear Province on the evening of April 9, 2024 at the Provincial Information Department.
The event was attended by Ms. Hem Sokun Pisey, Advisor to the Ministry of Information and Director of Preah Vihear Provincial Information Department, as well as provincial leaders, directors of departments around the province, district governors and government officials working in Preah Vihear Provincial Information and Journalism Department. Another unit.
Mr. Kim Rithy stated that he loves and respects the media and wants the media to act as a mirror to reflect the reality of society as well as the reality and activities of our civil servants. He added that journalists are a mirror, as well as showing the rights and freedoms of the people.
According to Mr. Kim Rithy, there are three levels of journalism: Level 1: Broadcasting raw news is what you see, what you see, what you say, level 2: When we see and we have to analyze, when we analyze, then we start to write, for level Third, the art of writing, we see, we analyze, we analyze, and we compile an article to write in a way that appeals to the hearts of the people.
Mr. Kim Rithy also expressed his happiness after taking office as the Governor of Preah Vihear for a year and a half, our journalists have given him justice to his officials from the provincial level. Basically.
He confirmed that until now, he has never quarreled with journalists in the past, if the journalist is correct, we correct, but if the journalist is wrong, we let him clarify.
The Governor of Preah Vihear Province also said that at the end of 2023 and the beginning of 2024, we will set up more mechanisms faster than before, with a spokesperson for the provincial administration, the director of the provincial information department and the information management team. 5 more to disseminate information quickly and on time.
That is, what you want is for something to happen, to respond immediately, do not owe the case, waiting for tomorrow, at the same time, he will continue to strengthen good relations between the media and the provincial administration, departments, units and administration. Municipalities, districts, communes, sangkats at the local level to be closer.
