(Battambang): On April 9, 2024, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior Abhisit Bandit Sar Sokha visited the International Coconut Gate in Kamrieng District, Battambang Province, bordering Thailand. In particular, welcome and greet the Cambodian people who are workers who travel back to the motherland on the occasion of preparing to celebrate the traditional New Year.
