(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Tuesday, April 9, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting. And raise the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Planning.
