The National Technical Training Institute (ITTI) has also recently celebrated Sankranti, with the cooperation of partner companies, organizations and solidarity from the institute's youth group. The institute's Sankranti program is in line with the traditional Khmer tradition, with many popular games and traditional programs.
The Director of the National Technical Training Institute of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training, HE Yok Sothy, said that the Institute organized Sankranti on March 23-24, 2024, with students, representatives of organizations, companies, partners and many other guests. Participated in large numbers.
