Through the message, Mr. Veang Huy will confirm: "I am pleased to receive the news of the election of Samdech Techo as President of the Senate of the Kingdom of Cambodia. On behalf of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference (CPPCC) and on my own behalf, I would like to extend my warmest congratulations to the President.
The Chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference also wished the Kingdom of Cambodia prosperity and the people of Cambodia happiness, and wished Samdech Techo continued success in all his noble tasks.
The following is a message from the chairman of the National Committee of the Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference:
