The following is the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Murder, murder, cremation in Poipet City, the force of the Criminal Police Department led the search and crackdown on the perpetrators
On March 29, 2024, the villagers burned the garbage in the landfill and found the body to be burned in the pit with the same characteristics as the victim and reported to the authorities.
After the autopsy, the body was cut off on the wrists and fingers, and burned at the crematorium, leaving only the body, muscles and hands and head burned in Andong Thmor Meas village, Phsar Kandal commune, Poipet city. .
After receiving the information, following the orders of General Sar Thet, the National Police Commissioner, the Deputy Commissioner for Planning, the Deputy Commissioner General of the Department, Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, the director of the Criminal Police Department, ordered the specialized force to open a search.
The specialized force of the Criminal Police Department, led by Brigadier General Hun Moniroth and Mr. Hem Bona and Lt. Col. Chan Kimly, Deputy Director of the Department, cooperated with the specialized force of Poipet City Police Inspectorate to use specialized measures to conduct procedural research until identification And the suspect's whereabouts.
On March 6, 2024, at 5:00 PM, the specialized force of the Criminal Police Department continued to search until they arrested a suspect named Chea Sarach, male, 24 years old, Khmer nationality, at the point of Sangkat Poipet, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
Currently, the perpetrators have been handed over to the Poipet City Police Inspectorate for further action.
