Cambodian Entrepreneurship Financing Assistance Package Awarded to 38 New Businesses and Small and Medium Enterprises for Rehabilitation and Expansion
(Phnom Penh): 38 new businesses and small and medium enterprises were selected by Cambodian entrepreneurs and selected to provide assistance packages to Cambodian entrepreneurs to support those small and medium enterprises, restore business and maintain balance in seizing new opportunities to expand Business according to the respective sectors.
