Cambodian Association of Finance and Technology: The evolution of digital systems will accelerate Cambodia's journey towards a cashless society
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Association of Finance and Technology (CAFT) has said that the evolution of digital systems will accelerate Cambodia's journey towards a cashless society. This is according to the association's press release.
The Association of Finance and Technology of Cambodia said this after a recent press release related to a study on the behavior of customers or consumers in paying for the purchase of goods or services in Cambodia. Held from October to November 2023, Clear M&C Saatchi stated that the use of digital payment methods in Cambodia is still low and the use of cash continues to increase.
