Allowances for civil servants and the armed forces on the occasion of New Year and Pchum Ben have been implemented by the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen for several terms. Habits as an encouraging culture for civil servants to work hard for the nation and the people have continued to the new government led by Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet.
The decision of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia at this time has made both civil servants and the armed forces very happy and satisfied.
