With pleasure, Mr. Chan Sarin saw that the financial support for New Year and Pchum Ben, as well as the increase in salary, clearly shows the head of the Royal Government's consideration for the lives of civil servants and is also a great encouragement. Great for civil servants to do their job.
Public government reform is one of the priorities of the Royal Government of Cambodia in the seventh legislature. Samdech President Hun Manet has given the principle to strengthen the capacity of 80 percent of civil servants and expand only 20 percent. In other words, Samdech Thipdey encourages to strengthen the capacity of existing officials more than the new ones.
