Dr. Yong Pov emphasized that, in fact, the Royal Academy of Cambodia has raised the traditional dance art and released the Khmer folk game, which is to cultivate our national spirit, we do not blame anyone, we must join together.
Dr. Yong Pov also requested the people, the competent authorities to the ministries and institutions to value the cultural heritage of Cambodia by participating together, if we do not participate, do not value the Khmer cultural arts when we lose. Blame this person, blame that person is not right, so until we join together from now on.
