(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Senate on the afternoon of April 5, 2024 issued a proclamation showing the results of the first session of the Senate of the 5th legislature this morning, April 5, chaired by Mr. Prak Sokhon, Acting President of the Senate. Happy New Year Gift! Many other directors of specialized departments announced their support and thanks to Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet for deciding to upgrade the specialized departments to equal the departments.
(Phnom Penh): After receiving a wonderful gift from Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on the occasion of the National New Year, Samdech Prakas and officially issued a sub-decree to promote all ministries and departments. Along with that department, the directors of the specialized departments in many provinces posted messages of deep gratitude to the Prime Minister for their encouragement.
Through their Facebook accounts, the directors of the department posted similar content: "Thank you very much and I would like to solemnly declare my full support for the Royal Government's Sub-Decree No. 91 on the promotion. Equivalent to department to sub-national unit.
The decision to issue a sub-decree on the promotion of departments to sub-national units is the wise idea of His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia on public administration reform as well as to improve work efficiency. "And governance at state institutions, both nationally and sub-nationally, especially to encourage us as leaders at the grassroots level."
Please be informed that Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the afternoon of April 4, 2024, announced and issued a sub-decree on the promotion of specialized departments, police commissioners, provincial military operation areas and military police under the Capital Administration. Province to equal the department.
He asserted that there was nothing wrong with the promotion, and that the promotion was to encourage more officials to take on more jobs and to increase their authority and responsibility, and that the promotion would not affect the hierarchy. Ordered in the provincial capital.
Please be informed that before the announcement of the promotion of the director of the specialized department, the police commissioner, the commander of the provincial military operation area and the commander of the military police in the capitals and provinces have the same rank as the deputy director of the department, only the proclamation of the minister in each ministry Each, but after this installation, the appointment must be issued by sub-decree by the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
