This religious ceremony is to respect the traditions and customs of the people and show the peace of the people while the country is completely peaceful under the shadow of peace, which maintains the economic, social progress and development in all areas of the people. The whole of Cambodia. There is no spraying with water cannons and disorder in the celebration of the New Year at the Royal University of Fine Arts.
