(Phnom Penh): Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, stated that in order to control the number of journalists in Cambodia clearly, the Ministry has issued ID cards.
A new type of high quality journalism with QR code and use of a verification nursery in collaboration with the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications to prevent the forgery of journalists' ID cards.
