(Phnom Penh): Mr. Voeung Din Hoeur, President of the National Assembly of Vietnam, sent a congratulatory message to Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of his election as the President of the Senate for the 5th term in the first session of the 5th Senate on April 3, 2024, under the highest presidency of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The President of the National Assembly of Vietnam stated in the full letter:
